# A page number past the end is refused, and the refusal is said where the
# number was typed, not tucked behind a Details control.
wait-for Try a sample comic
tap Try a sample comic
wait-for CBZ
tap-at 536,1378
wait-for Available on this reader
tap Open
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Fit page
tap Go to page
wait-for Enter a page from 1 to 4
tap-id comic-digit-9
wait-for 9
tap Go
wait-idle
clean
shot go-to-page-refused
expect Choose a page from 1 to 4.
